Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Lands the capsule admission/owner-binding/worker-contract stack on main and fixes
what failed daveey/hermes#642 (run 41409661890, 7 of 8 Python shards red).

Problem: 42 tests failed on #642's head across 16 files.
Why 1 (31 tests, agent/tui_gateway/hermes_state flush tests): AttributeError
  'SimpleNamespace' has no '_flush_messages_to_session_db_retrying' — the
  observation wrapper called the renamed body through self, and stub agents call
  SessionPersistenceMixin._flush_messages_to_session_db unbound (log: run 41409661890).
  Fix: class-qualified call; the sentinel text Ask Eve's observer_entry checks
  ('observe_persisted(self, result)') is unchanged.
Why 2 (test_kanban_lockguard): kanban_capsule_owner.card_requires_capsule opened the
  board with raw sqlite3.connect. Fix: kanban_lockguard.connect.
Why 3 (test_kanban_turn_recovery): the submitter always passed owner_check= to
  connect_gateway. Fix: only for capsule-required cards, so ordinary cards call it
  exactly as before.
Why 4 (test_managed_worker_unknown_status): its fixture froze kanban_json without
  'db'; the gate re-derives from the board and fails closed (by design). Fix: the
  fixture freezes a real scratch card on a real board, as build_kanban_policy does.
Root (not caught): #642 was based on fix/trusted-capsule-admission, so its CI was
  the first full-suite run of the stack; the branch had only run targeted tests.

Conflicts with main resolved: create-time capsule attestation now flows through
kanban_db_creation.validate_create_assignment (project_id/project_repo); nonspawnable
reuses kanban_db_dispatch_preclaim.note_nonspawnable; kanban_show's capsule view lives
in tools/kanban_tools_capsule.py; the capsule Workspace rewrite (gateway/
session_kanban_capsule.py) also covers the restart-resume first turn at its shifted
span (resume_context_workspace), failing closed without it.

Health (no allow comments): capsule guidance selection -> agent/agent_init_capsule.py;
capsule fixtures -> tests/tools/capsule_fixtures.py registered by tests/tools/conftest.py
(fixes F811); dispatcher capsule claim -> kanban_db_dispatch_admission.admitted_claim
(CC); blind excepts log tracebacks; file caps offset by moving
_reject_startup_spaced_model, _assistant_reasoning_text and _eligible_rows into
topical siblings.
